          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buseli bw'emiiga ya Etiopia nihahulirwayo amapapa g'ebilikuharara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi egyo netuma entumwa, entumwa nizisabara omu maato g'ebifunjo omuli Naili. Inywe ntumwa zirahuka, mushube owanyu omu nsi ebeganwa emiiga, ey'eihanga ly'abantu abaraibarai abanguha, abantu abatinwa ahaihi n'aharai, eihanga ly'amani elisinga endashana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhulire inywe bantu inywena atuli omu nsi, abakagituramu. Mulebe ebendera eyo baija kusimba aha butwelere bw'amabanga! Mwikare muhulilize eiraka ly'enzamba! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuba Omukama angambiire ati, “Nyemire mtuli ndi nindeba, tindikwekara, ninshana akashana mutagata, ninshusha orume orushura omushana omu bukiro bw'amagesha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eigesha litakagobire, orwo enyakyo ziragara, aho ezabibu zikabanza kwera, omubisha alikwata empabyo ashare ebililizi, n'amatagi agalikuranda agaguture. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emitumbi yabo yona elibwe amahungu g'omu mabanga n'ebikaaka by'omw'ishwa. Amahungu galye emitumbi egyo omu kyanda, n'ebikaaka byona by'omw'ishwa bigilye omu kirumo ky'embeho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho nirwo Omukama w'amahe tulimuletera ebihongo, bililetwa abantu abaraibarai mara ab'amani, eihanga elitinwa abatani n'ab'aharai, eihanga ly'amani elitasingwa mu ndashana, ensi elikurabwamu emiiga, negoba aha Ibanga lya Sioni mtuli Omukama w'amahe asingiire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.18.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
